  "title": "WasteSegregationAI: Regulation-Guided Visual Question Answering Framework",
  "summary": "WasteAssistant introduces a language-guided vision-AI framework for waste segregation, integrating vision-language models and multimodal AI to align with India's Solid Waste Management Rules 2016. The framework achieves 0.8291 BLEU scores and 92.73 BERTScore, outperforming traditional CNN-based methods, while supporting scalable deployment for sustainable urban infrastructure.",
  "facts": [
